## 📋 Per-Shoe Setup Workflow

| Step | Action | Tool |
|------|--------|------|
| 1 | Copy prompt from above → generate in Veo 3 | Veo 3 |
| 2 | Extract first frame | `ffmpeg -i shoe.mp4 -vframes 1 first_frame.png` |
| 3 | Download product image from one8.com CDN URLs above | Browser |
| 4 | Create tracking card (product image + dark bg + one8 branding) | Photoshop/Figma |
| 5 | Upload video to CDN | GitHub + jsDelivr / Firebase |
| 6 | Import tracker + first frame into Unity | `Assets/AR_Assets/Images/` |
| 7 | Run AR Setup Wizard | `Tools → AR Setup Automation` |

### Video Specs

| Setting | Value |
|---------|-------|
| Resolution | 1080×1920 (Portrait) |
| Format | `.mp4` (H.264) |
| Duration | 5–8 seconds |
| FPS | 30 or 60 |
| Background | **#00FF00** green screen |

